  title "Starfire"
  summary "In a penguin civilization divided between the Aurora Stack and the Nightshelf, the Light-Regent Lianoshing learns forbidden fire-magic and attempts to bridge the two societies, but his warnings about an impending catastrophe go unheeded by both sides. When the Promenade Ward fractures and the Nightshelf descends into civil war with three competing leaders, Lianoshing's attempts at reconciliation fail, and he secretly steals resources to help the suffering while his precise ledgers hide an act of mercy. The Fracta conflict ends not through wisdom but exhaustion, leaving the civilization fractured and haunted by the consequences of refusing to acknowledge and mend the cracks that had always existed between them."
